ratiba-callback-parser: parseRatibaCallback reads responseHeader/ResponseHeader and responseData/ResponseData (name/value or Name/Value, mixable), returns resultCode/ok/ids, standingOrderId (reminderScheduleId), transactionId, status (status ?? Status), and a prototype-free data map of strings. Tested on both portal samples (as shown), mixed casing, no body, malformed entries, __proto__, and the three ValidationError paths.
